SUMMARY:Trek for Connectivity (Online)
DESCRIPTION:Join NCWF South Wake Conservationists Chapter in welcoming Cassia Rivera for a presentation about her trek across the state of North Carolina via the Mountains-to-Sea Trail. Learn about Cassia’s journey to raise awareness for the need to increases habitat connectivity statewide. Hear the story born from the trail and witness the beauty of North Carolina’s natural world\, illustrating that our state is worthy of protection and connection from the Coastal Plain\, through the Piedmont\, and into our Mountainous region! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/trek-for-connectivity-online/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/trekconnect.jpg
END:VEVENT
