SUMMARY:Invasive Plant Removal (Cary)
DESCRIPTION:Please join NCWF South Wake Conservationists Chapter for a stilt grass & liriope removal with the newly formed The Invasive Plant Removal Coalition of Cary. These grasses are either flowering or beginning to seed so it’s a critical time to remove them before they go to seed and spread further. The Coalition has invited local conservation groups to kick off this important work\, so you can expect some good fellowship with other like-minded individuals. Join us for this inaugural invasive removal at Annie Jones Greenway\, the first trail of its kind in Cary\, NC. We look forward to seeing you there! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/invasive-plant-removal-cary/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
