SUMMARY:Blue Ridge Snorkel Trail Adventure (Canton)
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to find out what’s swimming\, lurking\, floating\, and crawling in the Pigeon River? Now is your chance! Join NCWF ReWild AVL and Smoky Mountains Wilderness Watch as we explore the Pigeon River running through Canton. This site is a part of the Blue Ridge Snorkel Trail\, a collection of curated snorkel sites throughout North Carolina’s mountain rivers that provides a fun and educational outdoor adventure. \nPlease fill out the fields below. If you do not have your own snorkel gear and wetsuit\, we will do our best to accommodate your needs. Please note that this event is for adults only. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/blue-ridge-snorkel-trail-adventure-canton/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/snorkel.jpg
